# The formatter formats site code only. It never touches the text of a post.
#
# Automatic tidying rewrites line breaks, and where the author chose to break a
# line in a post is usually deliberate; after it runs once, the diff of the next
# real edit is unreadable. A formatter rewriting front matter can also change how
# a post is parsed and published, which turns an ergonomic complaint into a
# correctness one (`team.md` § Code Style).
content/
tests/u1/fixtures/
tests/u2/fixtures/

# Build output and installed packages.
dist/
coverage/
node_modules/
package-lock.json

# The AI-DLC workspace and the tooling directories are not site code.
aidlc/
